--- !u!114 &805654216
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 805654205}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5e024f7a239629a49ac6b36057a7237d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  pages:
  - pageImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7e45fdd9fb839df4783ae335c4c36172, type: 3}
    pageText: "ONGOING ISSUES - BOILER ROOM Date: 11/4/24 \n\nTech: Mike Donahue\nThird
      electrical short this month. Getting tired of resetting these circuits daily.\nROOT
      CAUSE: Finally figured it out. When humidity gets too high in here (above 80%), "
    pageTitle: 
  - pageImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7e45fdd9fb839df4783ae335c4c36172, type: 3}
    pageText: moisture builds up on those old circuit boards and trips everything.
      Same problem as last winter.
    pageTitle: 
  - pageImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7e45fdd9fb839df4783ae335c4c36172, type: 3}
    pageText: 'TEMP FIX: Need to reduce the steam output from the main boiler. That
      old pressure release valve (#3, west wall) is the culprit - runs too hot and
      dumps too much steam. Valve is completely seized - tried turning by hand but
      it won''t budge. Need the 14" pipe wrench to get any leverage on it.  '
    pageTitle: 
  - pageImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7e45fdd9fb839df4783ae335c4c36172, type: 3}
    pageText: "Would have fixed it today but my wrench is locked in that supply cabinet
      and the damn lock is completely seized up. Tried the key but it won't turn
      at all. Maintenance budget strikes again.  \nGetting sick of working in these
      conditions. If anyone reads this and I'm not here, feel free to take care of
      it. Just "
    pageTitle: 
  - pageImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7e45fdd9fb839df4783ae335c4c36172, type: 3}
    pageText: 'make sure you only turn that valve a QUARTER turn - any more and we
      risk pressure buildup.

      - Mike'
    pageTitle: 
  pageImageComponent: {fileID: 1285279103}
  pageTextComponent: {fileID: 1772355962}
  pageTitleComponent: {fileID: 33546805}
  pageCounterComponent: {fileID: 1571137221}
