--- !u!114 &1265656717
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1265656715}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5e024f7a239629a49ac6b36057a7237d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  pages:
  - pageImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7e45fdd9fb839df4783ae335c4c36172, type: 3}
    pageText: 'EQUIPMENT INVENTORY UPDATE Date: 3/8/24 From: Dave Jensen


      Quick
      update on missing tools reported last week:


      - Found the socket set
      (was behind water heater)

      - Still no sign of the digital multimeter

      -
      Replacement hammers arrived Tuesday'
    pageTitle: 
  - pageImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7e45fdd9fb839df4783ae335c4c36172, type: 3}
    pageText: 'SECURITY REMINDER: The bolt cutters are now stored in the safe. Three
      padlocks were cut last month and nobody''s owning up to it. $250 worth of tools
      walked out during that "authorized maintenance" that nobody seems to know anything
      about.'
    pageTitle: 
  - pageImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7e45fdd9fb839df4783ae335c4c36172, type: 3}
    pageText: Until we figure out who's accessing restricted areas without permission,
      the bolt cutters stay locked up. If you need them for legitimate work, see
      me or Tony for the safe combination.
    pageTitle: 
  - pageImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7e45fdd9fb839df4783ae335c4c36172, type: 3}
    pageText: "Also, whoever keeps borrowing my personal pliers and not returning
      them \\- knock it off. Buy your own tools. \nNext inventory check: 3/15 Missing
      items will come out of department budget.\n  Dave"
    pageTitle: 
  pageImageComponent: {fileID: 1517698945}
  pageTextComponent: {fileID: 299652868}
  pageTitleComponent: {fileID: 1442459748}
  pageCounterComponent: {fileID: 361795836}
  navigationHelpUI: {fileID: 889185229}
  leftArrowText: {fileID: 946800820}
  rightArrowText: {fileID: 819082117}
