  m_text: 'INCIDENT REPORT  #143 Date: 9/12/24 Filed by: Tony Vasquez


    Responding
    to emergency call at 2:15 AM. Found boiler offline, building cold.


    WHAT
    HAPPENED: Water leak from overhead pipe created puddle directly beneath main
    power switch. Previous shift either didn''t notice or ignored it. Water had splashed
    onto lower portion of electrical panel. Extremely dangerous situation.'
